<title>USA: Stillwater Mining CEO/chairman resigns.</title>
<headline>Stillwater Mining CEO/chairman resigns.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stillwater Mining Co said Friday that Charles Engles had resigned as chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Stillwater said Ray Ballmer, a director of the company, was appointed chairman on an interim basis until a successor to Engles is selected.</p>
</text>
